##RenderMan RIB-Structure 1.1
##Scene Two quads at two depths through a lens focused on the nearer one
version 3.03
Format 64 48 1
PixelSamples 4 4
Projection "perspective" "fov" [40]
Clipping 0.1 100
# a lens a quarter of a unit across, focused four units out: the red quad is on the plane
# of focus and the blue one, ten units out, is blurred by about five pixels
DepthOfField 1 0.5 4
WorldBegin
Surface "constant"
Color [0.9 0.2 0.2]
Polygon "P" [-1.5 -1 4  -0.2 -1 4  -0.2 1 4  -1.5 1 4]
Color [0.2 0.4 0.9]
Polygon "P" [0.5 -2.5 10  4 -2.5 10  4 2.5 10  0.5 2.5 10]
WorldEnd
